    <briefdescription>
<para>Base class for cap-like instruments. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><xrefsect id="test_1_test000019"><xreftitle>Tests</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>the correctness of the returned value is tested by checking that the price of a cap (resp. floor) decreases (resp. increases) with the strike rate.</para></listitem><listitem><para>the relationship between the values of caps, floors and the resulting collars is checked.</para></listitem><listitem><para>the put-call parity between the values of caps, floors and swaps is checked.</para></listitem><listitem><para>the correctness of the returned implied volatility is tested by using it for reproducing the target value.</para></listitem><listitem><para>the correctness of the returned value is tested by checking it against a known good value. </para></listitem></itemizedlist>
</para></xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>    </detaileddescription>
